              }
             },
             "content": "<p>Flieber is an AI-powered demand planning and inventory forecasting platform built to solve the complex challenges of modern multichannel brands. It's delivered through a clean, intuitive interface that operators can actually use.</p>\n<p>Netstock is an older inventory planning add-on built for legacy ERPs. Its outdated technology and rigid interface make it hard to keep up with the pace of modern commerce.</p>",
