       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "Two-Col-Content-Img",
         "name": "widget_1749723887648",
         "params": {
          "background_color": "#186DFF",
          "button": {
           "link": ""
          },
          "content": "<p>Flieber was designed from the start for multichannel operators. It supports brands selling on Shopify, Amazon, Walmart, wholesale, and more.</p>\n<p>Netstock was built as an ERP add-on for traditional retail brands. Its system breaks down under the complexity of marketplaces, bundles, and can\u2019t keep up with the pace of high-volume brands.</p>",
          "content_width": "435px",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "heading": "Made for the way modern commerce actually works",
          "image_field": {
           "alt": "modern-commerce",
           "height": 451,
           "loading": "lazy",
           "max_height": 901,
           "max_width": 970,
           "size_type": "exact",
           "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/modern-commerce.png",
           "width": 485
          },
          "module_id": 191281957771,
          "schema_version": 2,
          "subheading": "",
          "text_color": "#FFF"
         },
         "rowMetaData": [],
         "rows": [],
         "type": "custom_widget",
         "w": 12,
         "x": 0
        }
       },
       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "Two-Col-Content-Img",
         "name": "widget_1749706917812",
         "params": {
          "background_color": "#FFF",
          "button": {
           "link": ""
          },
          "content": "<p>Flieber delivers clear insights through a modern interface. Operators can act quickly without digging through spreadsheets or outdated dashboards.</p>\n<p>Netstock\u2019s interface inherits the clutter and friction of the ERPs it connects to, slowing down decision-making.</p>",
          "content_width": "340px",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "heading": "Insightful, usable, fast",
          "image_field": {
           "alt": "insightful",
           "height": 519,
           "loading": "lazy",
           "max_height": 1038,
           "max_width": 1050,
           "size_type": "exact",
